    conclusion:'Copper in the south, blueberries and oil in the north, a global tourism economy in the mountains — four regions trading with the world and none with a school built for it. Done with discipline, a supplementary international track closes that gap. Book an assessment for your child, or start with our Arequipa, Trujillo and Cusco pages.',
